#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:5
#: 75773a0cf06648f2a25897832ae645a3 a985aa8feba04e6aa92afdd1b975eda0
#: ca5f166a47bc45b4857fc761460e0fae
msgid "Landing Gear/ Retractable Camera Mount"
msgstr "起落架/可收放摄像头云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:7
#: 47a9e3d7be1f4e48a26d387bf8d0de43 47ce7c7ce4264989bb4ce18ccabde119
#: 7c400131795b4e62b0183531f3700f69
msgid ""
"Copter and Plane support retractable Landing Gear / Camera Mounts activated "
"by a servo mechanism(like these sold by `Hobby King "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/quanum-600-class-quick-release-universal-"
"retractable-gear-set-680uc-pro-hexa-copter.html?___store=en_us>`__ for "
"copters). The gear/ mount can be manually retracted or deployed with an "
"auxiliary switch. The gear will also automatically deploy during landing "
"and/or retract during takeoff. The output which controls the servo for "
"landing gear/ camera mount is set by the SERVOx_FUNCTION =29."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和 Plane 支持通过舵机机构驱动的可收放起落架/摄像头云台（例如 `Hobby King "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/quanum-600-class-quick-release-universal-"
"retractable-gear-set-680uc-pro-hexa-copter.html?___store=en_us>`__ "
"销售的多旋翼用起落架）。起落架/云台可通过辅助开关手动收放，也会在降落时自动展开和/或在起飞时自动收起。控制起落架/摄像头云台舵机的输出由 "
"SERVOx_FUNCTION =29 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:12
#: 509da6e8396343cbb5df448c58a21026 9203c37c62c5413391c0f02a92046979
#: 9bbe6b849cc8489282268a0b00b7181c
msgid ""
"During startup, the status of the landing gear/ camera mount is determined "
"by the :ref:`LGR_STARTUP<LGR_STARTUP>`  parameter. Starting either in "
"deployed or retracted state can be selected, or to wait for pilot input, "
"which prevents PWM signals from being active on the outputs whose "
"SERVOx_FUNCTION = 29 (Landing Gear). This prevents the current position of "
"those outputs from changing until the pilot or automatic operation commands "
"a change."
msgstr ""
"启动时，起落架/摄像头云台的状态由 :ref:`LGR_STARTUP<LGR_STARTUP>` "
"参数决定。可选择以展开或收起状态启动，或等待飞手输入，这样可防止 PWM 信号在 SERVOx_FUNCTION = "
"29（起落架）的输出上处于激活状态。这样可防止这些输出的当前位置发生变化，直到飞手或自动操作命令变更。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:14
#: 1277c21eec68461a8ad1703574149356 7c58709129e3467aac108d0343862616
#: 800d006ef67940259d0f15d197fd69ee
msgid ""
"Retraction and deployment happen automatically in AUTO mode (and Plane MODE "
"TAKEOFF takeoffs), AUTO mode landings, and final land or glide phase of RTL "
"landings, for both Plane (including AUTOLAND mode) and Copter. And happen "
"when changing to LAND mode for Copter. The :ref:`LGR_OPTIONS<LGR_OPTIONS>` "
"bitmask can selectively enable or disable these operations. If bit 0 is set,"
" the automatic retractions are enabled, and if bit 1 is set, then automatic "
"deployment occurs. Either or both bits can be set. Default is both bits set,"
" enabling automatic deployment and retraction. The manual switch, if "
"programmed, can change the deploy/retract state of the gear at any time."
msgstr ""
"在 Auto 模式（以及 Plane MODE TAKEOFF 起飞）、Auto 模式降落、RTL 降落的最终降落或滑翔阶段，Plane（含 "
"AUTOLAND 模式）和 Copter 均会自动收放起落架。切换到 LAND 模式时 Copter "
"也会自动展开起落架。:ref:`LGR_OPTIONS<LGR_OPTIONS>` 位掩码可选择性地启用或禁用这些操作。若第 0 "
"位被设置，则启用自动收起；若第 1 "
"位被设置，则启用自动展开。两位均可设置。默认两位均设置，同时启用自动展开和收起。如果已编程手动开关，则可随时改变起落架的展开/收起状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:16
#: 2d9eaf2e22a74559acd8dff4b2d20d93
msgid ""
"In addition, the landing gear/ camera mount can automatically deploy or "
"retract based on altitude, using the :ref:`LGR_DEPLOY_ALT<LGR_DEPLOY_ALT>` "
"for automatic deployment below this altitude, and automatic retraction if "
"above the :ref:`LGR_RETRACT_ALT<LGR_RETRACT_ALT>`. If these are set to 0, "
"then these functions are not active."
msgstr ""
"此外，起落架/摄像头云台可根据高度自动展开或收起，使用 :ref:`LGR_DEPLOY_ALT<LGR_DEPLOY_ALT>` "
"在低于此高度时自动展开，以及在高于 :ref:`LGR_RETRACT_ALT<LGR_RETRACT_ALT>` 时自动收起。若这些参数设置为 "
"0，则这些功能不激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:23
#: 34a6532c701943358ae2eb59972fbca4 bb509732837042a196ca2b5e0f9a2039
#: db99cd67e3254ba69e3e7a2fbcd2a0f6
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:25
#: 293353419fc8465aaedde0938404a1a3 549b20ce74d641a0b7967b9478fdaf83
#: eb50889b4c63464f8c70bd479ff26731
msgid ""
"Most retractable landing gear will require just a single PWM cable to be "
"connected to one of the autopilot outputs, selected using the "
"SERVOx_FUNCTION set to 29 for that output. If the retractable landing gear "
"operation appears to be flipped (retracted when it should be deployed) you "
"can change this using the SERVOx_REVERSED parameter. Reversed operation "
"seems to be necessary with Tarot retractable landing gear legs without the "
"Tarot control box."
msgstr ""
"大多数可收放起落架只需将一根 PWM 线缆连接到飞控的一个输出，通过将该输出的 SERVOx_FUNCTION 设为 29 "
"来选择。如果可收放起落架的操作方向反了（收起时应展开），可通过 SERVOx_REVERSED 参数进行修改。对于不带 Tarot 控制盒的 Tarot"
" 可收放起落架腿，似乎需要反向操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:31
#: 44e41bb1e11d4ca99467c365e6424e10 7d98a7af75634eb883f84543f8d8ee41
#: b61ced84bc034f728e4c6954550e9fdc
msgid "Setup through the Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:33
#: 9b813d0d02994a228cad497c5c9e3b9e deecb30327724e5c920762ff632179c9
#: f0700a140e37481087cf9f3b4b89d26d
msgid ""
"Use the Mission Planner's Full Parameter List (or equivalent) to set the "
"above parameters and/or set an RC channel to be a manual control using the "
"RCx_OPTION = 29 for that channel. When the PWM for the channel is < 1200us, "
"the gear will be deployed, > 1800us it will be retracted, other values will "
"not change the gear's state. After the RC channel requests a deploy or "
"retract, an automatic function can override the manual control, until the "
"channel is moved to another state and/or returned."
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 的完整参数列表（或等效工具）设置上述参数，并/或通过将该通道的 RCx_OPTION = 29 设置 RC "
"通道为手动控制。当该通道 PWM < 1200us 时，起落架将展开；> 1800us 时将收起；其他值不改变起落架状态。RC "
"通道请求展开或收起后，自动功能可覆盖手动控制，直到通道移动到另一状态和/或返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:37
#: 5e9d1e98602b406190c9668eec68a36d 87b5665fc87f434ea72dc0ff3fb738ca
#: be7147444ed0499dbc0d795bddd444aa
msgid "Other Parameters"
msgstr "其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:39
#: 0e08e56812ab4a678705a33116c92703 1b2fc6f76c184aff8fd12dab70cd2986
#: b1ae0e43bc4f4b418c76290c64430443
msgid ""
"There are additional landing gear/ camera mount features in development for "
"future releases and therefore other ``LGR_`` parameters are listed not "
"covered in this topic, but they are only used for logging purposes at this "
"time and do not affect operation."
msgstr ""
"未来版本正在开发其他起落架/摄像头云台功能，因此列出了本主题未涵盖的其他 ``LGR_`` 参数，但目前这些参数仅用于日志记录，不影响实际操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-landing-gear.rst:16
#: b77fe51dbcc0416e9866412d2f1123a1 be82635262614bdaac39ed6270b22042
msgid ""
"In addition, the landing gear/ camera mount can automatically deploy or "
"retract based on altitude, using the :ref:`LGR_DEPLOY_ALT<LGR_DEPLOY_ALT>` "
"for automatic deployment when descending through this altitude, and "
"automatic retraction when climbing through the "
":ref:`LGR_RETRACT_ALT<LGR_RETRACT_ALT>`. If these are set to 0, then these "
"functions are not active."
msgstr ""
"此外，起落架/相机支架可以根据高度自动放下或收起：下降穿过 :ref:`LGR_DEPLOY_ALT<LGR_DEPLOY_ALT>` "
"设定的高度时自动放下，爬升穿过 :ref:`LGR_RETRACT_ALT<LGR_RETRACT_ALT>` 设定的高度时自动收起。若这些参数设为 "
"0，则相应功能不启用。"
